T1  - The Role of Multimodal Generative AI in Older Adults’ Health Management: Systematic Scoping Review
AU  - Liu, Ting
AU  - Luo, Yiming Taclis
AU  - Pang, Patrick Cheong-Iao
AU  - Zhang, Haopeng
AU  - Xiang, Ao
AU  - Yang, Qin
